{
  "server": "en",
  "storyId": "act12d0_level_act12d0_03_end",
  "groupId": "act12d0",
  "stageId": "act12d0_03",
  "title": "Old Times",
  "storyCode": "RI-3",
  "avgTag": "After Operation",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/en/gamedata/story/activities/act12d0/level_act12d0_03_end.txt",
  "sourceHash": "2476394780a5079e6fc170bbe5f2dcea54a00356ccf322bee518e3d159962cb7",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Archosauria A",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "This weirdo's way too strong! She's beaten back so many of us already!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Archosauria B",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "I still don't get what she's saying, but she's no joke!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Archosauria C",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "I reckon she'd make a fine Great Chief!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Tomimi",
      "speakerToken": "char_411_tomimi_1#2",
      "operatorId": "char_411_tomimi",
      "portraitKey": "char_411_tomimi",
      "text": "...Gavial, your friend's really strong."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Gavial",
      "speakerToken": "char_187_ccheal_1",
      "operatorId": "char_187_ccheal",
      "portraitKey": "char_187_ccheal",
      "text": "She sure is a pain in the ass at times like this though."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Gavial",
      "speakerToken": "char_187_ccheal_1",
      "operatorId": "char_187_ccheal",
      "portraitKey": "char_187_ccheal",
      "text": "I think we finally hit a lull. I'm gonna go up there and restrain her..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ceobe",
      "speakerToken": "char_2013_cerber_1",
      "operatorId": "char_2013_cerber",
      "portraitKey": "char_2013_cerber",
      "text": "You, Reunion! You're back!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ceobe",
      "speakerToken": "char_2013_cerber_1",
      "operatorId": "char_2013_cerber",
      "portraitKey": "char_2013_cerber",
      "text": "So you were the ones who took the Doctor!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ceobe",
      "speakerToken": "char_2013_cerber_1",
      "operatorId": "char_2013_cerber",
      "portraitKey": "char_2013_cerber",
      "text": "You won't get away!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Gavial",
      "speakerToken": "char_187_ccheal_1#2",
      "operatorId": "char_187_ccheal",
      "portraitKey": "char_187_ccheal",
      "text": "Oh, you dumb... She's gonna escape again!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Gavial",
      "speakerToken": "char_187_ccheal_1#2",
      "operatorId": "char_187_ccheal",
      "portraitKey": "char_187_ccheal",
      "text": "I'm going after her! Tomimi, you and the Doctor stay put! I'll come back and find you!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Tomimi",
      "speakerToken": "char_411_tomimi_1#2",
      "operatorId": "char_411_tomimi",
      "portraitKey": "char_411_tomimi",
      "text": "Uh, okay!"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Tomimi",
      "speakerToken": "char_411_tomimi_1#5",
      "operatorId": "char_411_tomimi",
      "portraitKey": "char_411_tomimi",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "......",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Tomimi",
          "speakerToken": "char_411_tomimi_1#5",
          "operatorId": "char_411_tomimi",
          "portraitKey": "char_411_tomimi",
          "text": "Oh, there's another fight starting."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Tomimi",
          "speakerToken": "char_411_tomimi_1#5",
          "operatorId": "char_411_tomimi",
          "portraitKey": "char_411_tomimi",
          "text": "...Doctor, could you tell me what Gavial is like on the outside?"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "(Tell her about Gavial's life at Rhodes Island.)",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "Tomimi",
              "speakerToken": "char_411_tomimi_1#5",
              "operatorId": "char_411_tomimi",
              "portraitKey": "char_411_tomimi",
              "text": "Is Gavial having a good life out there, then?"
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "Tomimi",
              "speakerToken": "char_411_tomimi_1#5",
              "operatorId": "char_411_tomimi",
              "portraitKey": "char_411_tomimi",
              "text": "......"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "label": "......",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "Tomimi",
              "speakerToken": "char_411_tomimi_1#5",
              "operatorId": "char_411_tomimi",
              "portraitKey": "char_411_tomimi",
              "text": "Maybe you don't know Gavial that well?"
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "Tomimi",
              "speakerToken": "char_411_tomimi_1#5",
              "operatorId": "char_411_tomimi",
              "portraitKey": "char_411_tomimi",
              "text": "That's great! ...Um, no, I was just thinking since Gavial came back with you, and she seemed to really like you, and it looks like you get along really well."
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "Tomimi",
              "speakerToken": "char_411_tomimi_1#5",
              "operatorId": "char_411_tomimi",
              "portraitKey": "char_411_tomimi",
              "text": "But that's okay! Gavial's a really nice person! I think you can definitely get along with her!"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "label": "(Tell her about Gavial as a doctor.)",
          "value": "3",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "Tomimi",
              "speakerToken": "char_411_tomimi_1#3",
              "operatorId": "char_411_tomimi",
              "portraitKey": "char_411_tomimi",
              "text": "That's great! Even if she's a doctor, Gavial's still Gavial!"
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "Tomimi",
              "speakerToken": "char_411_tomimi_1#3",
              "operatorId": "char_411_tomimi",
              "portraitKey": "char_411_tomimi",
              "text": "That's good to know. Gavial hasn't changed. What a relief..."
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Tomimi",
          "speakerToken": "char_411_tomimi_1",
          "operatorId": "char_411_tomimi",
          "portraitKey": "char_411_tomimi",
          "text": "So if Gavial decided to leave you one day, how would you feel?"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "It'd be sad, for sure.",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "Tomimi",
              "speakerToken": "char_411_tomimi_1",
              "operatorId": "char_411_tomimi",
              "portraitKey": "char_411_tomimi",
              "text": "Mmm. I cried a lot when it happened, too..."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "label": "......",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "Tomimi",
              "speakerToken": "char_411_tomimi_1#2",
              "operatorId": "char_411_tomimi",
              "portraitKey": "char_411_tomimi",
              "text": "How... How could you be like that?! Gavial's such a good person! How could you care so little if she left?!"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "label": "I'd be glad she found a new path in life.",
          "value": "3",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "Tomimi",
              "speakerToken": "char_411_tomimi_1#2",
              "operatorId": "char_411_tomimi",
              "portraitKey": "char_411_tomimi",
              "text": "You're incredible... I couldn't do that."
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "Tomimi",
              "speakerToken": "char_411_tomimi_1#2",
              "operatorId": "char_411_tomimi",
              "portraitKey": "char_411_tomimi",
              "text": "I always hoped Gavial would come back."
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Tomimi",
          "speakerToken": "char_411_tomimi_1#2",
          "operatorId": "char_411_tomimi",
          "portraitKey": "char_411_tomimi",
          "text": "Doctor, um, about Gavial...! I-I'm not gonna let you take her from me!"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "Good luck.",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "(Nod.)",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "And I won't let you take her from me!",
          "value": "3",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": []
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "So how DID that ceremony back then turn out?",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Tomimi",
          "speakerToken": "char_411_tomimi_1",
          "operatorId": "char_411_tomimi",
          "portraitKey": "char_411_tomimi",
          "text": "Um, that one..."
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Gavial",
          "speakerToken": "char_187_ccheal_1#3",
          "operatorId": "char_187_ccheal",
          "portraitKey": "char_187_ccheal",
          "text": "Oh, what? You call me a kid, and this is all you've got?"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Gavial",
          "speakerToken": "char_187_ccheal_1#3",
          "operatorId": "char_187_ccheal",
          "portraitKey": "char_187_ccheal",
          "text": "Who else is gonna challenge me?!"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Archosauria A",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "She beat a lot of fighters more experienced than her..."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Archosauria B",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "Gavial, you rule!"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Archosauria C",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "It's wild to say, but could she be the next Great Chief?"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "???",
          "speakerToken": "char_416_zumama_1",
          "operatorId": "char_416_zumama",
          "portraitKey": "char_416_zumama",
          "text": "I'll take you on!"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Gavial",
          "speakerToken": "char_187_ccheal_1#3",
          "operatorId": "char_187_ccheal",
          "portraitKey": "char_187_ccheal",
          "text": "Oh, what the hell are you doing here, Zumama?"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Gavial",
          "speakerToken": "char_187_ccheal_1#3",
          "operatorId": "char_187_ccheal",
          "portraitKey": "char_187_ccheal",
          "text": "Weren't you busy building your machines? Every time I went looking for you, you ignored me."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Zumama",
          "speakerToken": "char_416_zumama_1",
          "operatorId": "char_416_zumama",
          "portraitKey": "char_416_zumama",
          "text": "...I decided to come and see, in the end."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Gavial",
          "speakerToken": "char_187_ccheal_1",
          "operatorId": "char_187_ccheal",
          "portraitKey": "char_187_ccheal",
          "text": "See what?"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Zumama",
          "speakerToken": "char_416_zumama_1#2",
          "operatorId": "char_416_zumama",
          "portraitKey": "char_416_zumama",
          "text": "See if my fists could beat you or not."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Gavial",
          "speakerToken": "char_187_ccheal_1",
          "operatorId": "char_187_ccheal",
          "portraitKey": "char_187_ccheal",
          "text": "You say that like you wanna get killed dead."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Zumama",
          "speakerToken": "char_416_zumama_1#2",
          "operatorId": "char_416_zumama",
          "portraitKey": "char_416_zumama",
          "text": "Enough talk. I'm not losing to you today, Gavial."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Gavial",
          "speakerToken": "char_187_ccheal_1#3",
          "operatorId": "char_187_ccheal",
          "portraitKey": "char_187_ccheal",
          "text": "Hey, you won't know until you've tried!"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Tomimi",
          "speakerToken": "char_411_tomimi_1",
          "operatorId": "char_411_tomimi",
          "portraitKey": "char_411_tomimi",
          "text": "They fought from noon until night without settling anything. No winner, no loser."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Tomimi",
          "speakerToken": "char_411_tomimi_1",
          "operatorId": "char_411_tomimi",
          "portraitKey": "char_411_tomimi",
          "text": "They went until they'd used all their strength, and afterwards, both of them got dragged off by the others."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Tomimi",
          "speakerToken": "char_411_tomimi_1",
          "operatorId": "char_411_tomimi",
          "portraitKey": "char_411_tomimi",
          "text": "That's the story of the first time Gavial joined the ceremony."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "What kind of person is Zumama?",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Tomimi",
          "speakerToken": "char_411_tomimi_1",
          "operatorId": "char_411_tomimi",
          "portraitKey": "char_411_tomimi",
          "text": "Zumama was someone from a different tribe, but she was fairly close."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Tomimi",
          "speakerToken": "char_411_tomimi_1",
          "operatorId": "char_411_tomimi",
          "portraitKey": "char_411_tomimi",
          "text": "Back when they were young, she and Gavial fought a lot. Gavial was stronger than her, but it wasn't like Zumama never won."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Tomimi",
          "speakerToken": "char_411_tomimi_1",
          "operatorId": "char_411_tomimi",
          "portraitKey": "char_411_tomimi",
          "text": "But then Gavial said Zumama just stopped caring about fighting for some reason. She started researching machines instead."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Tomimi",
          "speakerToken": "char_411_tomimi_1",
          "operatorId": "char_411_tomimi",
          "portraitKey": "char_411_tomimi",
          "text": "And I remember that day was the last time Zumama and Gavial ever fought."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Tomimi",
          "speakerToken": "char_411_tomimi_1",
          "operatorId": "char_411_tomimi",
          "portraitKey": "char_411_tomimi",
          "text": "After that, Zumama barely even showed her face anywhere. Eventually, her tribe moved away, and I never saw her again."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Tomimi",
          "speakerToken": "char_411_tomimi_1",
          "operatorId": "char_411_tomimi",
          "portraitKey": "char_411_tomimi",
          "text": "Not even at that final mess of a ceremony before Gavial left. She never came."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "......",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Gavial",
          "speakerToken": "char_187_ccheal_1#2",
          "operatorId": "char_187_ccheal",
          "portraitKey": "char_187_ccheal",
          "text": "I'm back."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Tomimi",
          "speakerToken": "char_411_tomimi_1#2",
          "operatorId": "char_411_tomimi",
          "portraitKey": "char_411_tomimi",
          "text": "Gavial! You're okay, right?"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Gavial",
          "speakerToken": "char_187_ccheal_1#3",
          "operatorId": "char_187_ccheal",
          "portraitKey": "char_187_ccheal",
          "text": "I'm fine. Tch. Kay's got a hell of a pair of legs. Just ran off and disappeared out of sight."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Gavial",
          "speakerToken": "char_187_ccheal_1#3",
          "operatorId": "char_187_ccheal",
          "portraitKey": "char_187_ccheal",
          "text": "But knowing how well she can fend for herself, I'm not worried. Tomimi, did Zumama get here yet?"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Tomimi",
          "speakerToken": "char_411_tomimi_1#2",
          "operatorId": "char_411_tomimi",
          "portraitKey": "char_411_tomimi",
          "text": "Not yet."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Archosauria",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_070",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "Who else will challenge me?!"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "???",
          "speakerToken": "char_416_zumama_1",
          "operatorId": "char_416_zumama",
          "portraitKey": "char_416_zumama",
          "text": "I will."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Gavial",
          "speakerToken": "char_187_ccheal_1#3",
          "operatorId": "char_187_ccheal",
          "portraitKey": "char_187_ccheal",
          "text": "Hmm? Looks like I came back at just the right time."
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
